POWER BI MAP CONTEXT
  The Shape Map in powerbi/ draws context round the suburbs, generalised and cut to the map frame: suburbs and
  localities with the water mesh blocks cut out (Australian Bureau of Statistics, ASGS Edition 3, Suburbs and
  Localities 2021 and Mesh Blocks 2021, CC BY 4.0). Water is the map background showing where no land is drawn.
